</svg></div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="page-container-2"><div class="fitness-instructors-section padding-global"><div class="fitness-instructors-sec"><div id="w-node-_0a113731-3f90-107b-6e65-059f714fba45-714fba43" class="image-box"><img class="best-class-instructor-image" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6949433bade2d703c90660e8/6b05ba503c4a788cfa95907e_BARRYS_CREECH_LIFT_05_063_2000w.webp" height="580" alt="Best in class fitness instructors" sizes="100vw" title="Location Exclusive, Lift Room" loading="lazy" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6949433bade2d703c90660e8/6b05ba503c4a788cfa95907e_BARRYS_CREECH_LIFT_05_063_2000w-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6949433bade2d703c90660e8/6b05ba503c4a788cfa95907e_BARRYS_CREECH_LIFT_05_063_2000w-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6949433bade2d703c90660e8/6b05ba503c4a788cfa95907e_BARRYS_CREECH_LIFT_05_063_2000w-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6949433bade2d703c90660e8/6b05ba503c4a788cfa95907e_BARRYS_CREECH_LIFT_05_063_2000w-p-1600.webp 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6949433bade2d703c90660e8/6b05ba503c4a788cfa95907e_BARRYS_CREECH_LIFT_05_063_2000w.webp 2000w"/></div><div id="w-node-_0a113731-3f90-107b-6e65-059f714fba47-714fba43" class="content-box"><div class="workout-heading">BEST-IN-CLASS<br/> FITNESS INSTRUCTORS</div><div class="join-husstle-box"><div class="workout-heading-subheading">JOIN THE HUSTLE</div><div class="workout-list-description"><div class="description-text">New to Barry’s? You’re in good hands. Our instructors cue every interval, offer options for every level, and help you feel confident fast. Let them know before class if you’re brand new, coming back from time off, or working around an injury—they’ll help you choose the right speeds, weights, and modifications.</div></div><div class="footer-booking home-best-in-class"><a href="/studios" current_section="get-on-the-list-form" aria-label="Book your first class" data-wf-native-id-path="4dcb8e86-cb6b-53e6-0e9a-83cb483c0064:0a113731-3f90-107b-6e65-059f714fba53" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="0a113731-3f90-107b-6e65-059f714fba53" data-wf-component-context="%5B%7B%22componentId%22%3A%220a113731-3f90-107b-6e65-059f714fba43%22%2C%22instanceId%22%3A%224dcb8e86-cb6b-53e6-0e9a-83cb483c0064%22%7D%5D" class="global-secondary-button w-button">BOOK YOUR FIRST CLASS</a></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="page-container-2"><section id="lifestyle-section" class="the--lifestyle--wrapper padding-section-medium global"><div class="lifestyle--box padding-global"><div class="lifestyle--content-block-copy"><h3 class="lifestyle-heading red-title-text">MORE THAN JUST A WORKOUT</h3><h2 class="lifestyle-section-heading">YOU&#x27;RE EXACTLY WHERE<br/>YOU NEED TO BE</h2></div><div class="section-image-with--text-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="section-image-text-list w-dyn-items"><div id="w-node-ae4408af-62a0-fdbe-5c3d-6b51480ab2c9-c90661b8" role="listitem" class="section-image-with--text w-dyn-item"><div class="image--box"><img alt="Fuel Bar" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69497ece33c24736852ceba2/69dfc3ec59adadc98ecc01ac_Frame%2015111380762.webp" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69497ece33c24736852ceba2/69dfc3ec59adadc98ecc01ac_Frame%2015111380762-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69497ece33c24736852ceba2/69dfc3ec59adadc98ecc01ac_Frame%2015111380762.webp 715w" class="image-text--img"/></div><div class="content--box"><div class="image--text-content-block"><div class="lifestyle-heading-wrapper"><h3 class="image-text--heading">Fuel Bar</h3><div class="image-icon-logo"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69497ece33c24736852ceba2/697bb32758df07461db24d52_fuel-bar-logo.svg" loading="lazy" title="Fuel bar by Barrys" alt="Fuel bar by barrys" class="lifestyle-icon-img"/></div></div><div class="image-text--desc w-richtext"><p>Real nutrition, unreal convenience. The Barry’s Fuel Bar offers high-performance shakes and supplements that power your body without slowing down your life. PRO TIP: Pre-order your shake before class so it&#x27;s waiting for you once you&#x27;re done.</p></div></div></div></div><div id="w-node-ae4408af-62a0-fdbe-5c3d-6b51480ab2c9-c90661b8" role="listitem" class="section-image-with--text w-dyn-item"><div class="image--box"><img alt="Locker Rooms" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69497ece33c24736852ceba2/69dfc3d3d7eebfde05c314ff_Frame%201511138076.webp" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69497ece33c24736852ceba2/69dfc3d3d7eebfde05c314ff_Frame%201511138076-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69497ece33c24736852ceba2/69dfc3d3d7eebfde05c314ff_Frame%201511138076.webp 715w" class="image-text--img"/></div><div class="content--box"><div class="image--text-content-block"><div class="lifestyle-heading-wrapper"><h3 class="image-text--heading">Locker Rooms</h3></div><div class="image-text--desc w-richtext"><p>Private showers, plush towels, and Dyson hair dryers. Enjoy OUAI products including: Hand Wash, Hand Lotion (can be used for body too!), Detox Shampoo, Medium Hair Conditioner, Body Cleanser, and Detox Face Cleanser (only found at Barry&#x27;s).</p></div></div></div></div><div id="w-node-ae4408af-62a0-fdbe-5c3d-6b51480ab2c9-c90661b8" role="listitem" class="section-image-with--text w-dyn-item"><div class="image--box"><img alt="The Barry’s Shop" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69497ece33c24736852ceba2/69dfc4028737524b07156f99_Frame%2015111380763.webp" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69497ece33c24736852ceba2/69dfc4028737524b07156f99_Frame%2015111380763-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69497ece33c24736852ceba2/69dfc4028737524b07156f99_Frame%2015111380763.webp 715w" class="image-text--img"/></div><div class="content--box"><div class="image--text-content-block"><div class="lifestyle-heading-wrapper"><h3 class="image-text--heading">THE BARRY&#x27;S SHOP</h3></div><div class="image-text--desc w-richtext"><p>From iconic Barry&#x27;s apparel to exclusive collaborations, the Barry&#x27;s Shop brings Red Room power into your daily life.</p></div><div class="card-button-wrapper"><a data-figma-id="3009:1588" data-wf-native-id-path="ae4408af-62a0-fdbe-5c3d-6b51480ab306_instance-2" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="ae4408af-62a0-fdbe-5c3d-6b51480ab306" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2269497f83de1a8e8b835e78af%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%22694985252ec09da92c173c93%22%7D%5D" href="https://shop.barrys.com" class="button-container ghost-button-container w-inline-block"><p data-figma-id="3009:1589" class="ghost-secondary-button-text">Explore The Barry&#x27;s Shop</p><div class="caret-icon w-embed"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
