</svg></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="button--wrapper lifestyle-button"><a href="/the-lifestyle" data-wf-native-id-path="ae4408af-62a0-fdbe-5c3d-6b51480ab30e" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="ae4408af-62a0-fdbe-5c3d-6b51480ab30e" class="global-primary-button w-button">Explore All Amenities</a></div></section></div><div class="page-container-2"><div class="review-block"><div class="review-heading"><h2 class="lifestyle-section-heading">8+ Million Strong</h2><div class="image-text--desc">Join a global community that shows up, works hard, and starts exactly where you are.</div></div><div class="swiper-component"><div class="review-slider-mask"><div id="review-slider" class="swiper-container w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="swiper-wrapper w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="global-swipper-video-box"><div class="review-sectionbox review-testimonial"><div style="background-image:url(&quot;https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69497ece33c24736852ceba2/697bb9ba923dca6a0e825785_revie-sample.avif&quot;)" class="review-content-box"><div class="review-content-desc"><div class="review-desc-blok"><div class="review-description">The best workout around! I love Barry’s. It can be intimidating to go to a new gym, but because Barry’s fosters such a wonderful sense of community I’ve always felt welcomed.</div></div><div class="star-icon-boxc"><div class="star-icon w-embed"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
